<title>ITALY: Italy November wholesale prices rose 1.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italy November wholesale prices rose 1.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for November.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Nov 96     Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p> Year/Year change	  +1.7%	+2.1%    +10.4%</p>
<p> Month/Month change	-0.2%	+0.9%     +0.2%</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)    134.4	 134.7     132.2</p>
</text>
